sig
  bpm 130
  system 12tet western
  scale C chromatic

arr
  main 32 |opa

tracks
  1 Audio |wsd
    type audio
    strip tivraStrip
  2 MIDI |tdh
    type midi
    plugin tivraWavetable
    strip tivraStrip

returns
  0 Hall |rii
    fx tivraHall
    strip tivraStrip
  1 Plate |rrv
    fx tivraPlate
    strip tivraStrip
  2 Delay |rac
    fx tivraDelay
    strip tivraStrip
  3 Color |ruj
    fx tivraDistortion
    strip tivraStrip

master
  strip tivraMastering

sec main
